BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to the Microsoft 365 & Power Platform weekly community 
 call! This is a weekly recurrent call with 2 to 3 different topics around 
 the Microsoft 365 & Power Platform topics. Call is intended for the Micros
 oft to update the community on the latest news and updates - with live dem
 os.\n\nWe'll also include latest news and updates for building engaging so
 lutions and experiences in the Microsoft 365 platform.\n\n\n  *   Link to 
 join the Microsoft 365 Platform call from - https://aka.ms/m365-dev-call-j
 oin\n\n(notice. This is an aka.ms link as we might change the actual invit
 e URL. This way any changes are transparent for you if you access the call
  from above link)\n\nCommunity call recordings will be published at the Mi
 crosoft 365 Community YouTube channel at https://aka.ms/community/<https:/
 /aka.ms/community/videos>youtube - Subscribe to get notified the new daily
  videos!\n\nResources\n- Follow us on Twitter with @Microsoft365dev or @m3
 65pnp - we publish the call agenda in the social media always few days bef
 ore the call\n- Subscriber also to the Microsoft 365 Dev YouTube channel f
 or other Microsoft 365 developer videos at https://aka.ms/community/<https
 ://m365dev/videos>youtube\n- Community call summaries will be published at
  https://aka.ms/community/blog<https://aka.ms/m365pnp/community/blog>\n- L
 atest news on Microsoft 365 platform from Microsoft 365 developer blog at 
 https://developer.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-365/blogs/\n\nEasiest way 
 to find official docs\, SDKs and community assets - https://aka.ms/communi
 ty/home<https://aka.ms/community/homem365pnp>\n\n\n\n\n
