BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:The Power Platform Monthly community call happens on the 3rd We
 dnesday of each month. On the call\, we demonstrate tips and tools to help
  you build awesome Power Apps\, Power Automate\, Power Apps Portals\, Powe
 r Virtual Agents\, Power BI (and more) and discuss the latest Power Platfo
 rm news. You will meet the Power Platform product team and community exper
 ts to get your questions answered.\n\n\n__________________________________
 ______________________________________________\n\nMicrosoft Teams meeting\
 n\nJoin on your computer\, mobile app or room device\n\nClick here to join
  the meeting<https://aka.ms/PowerPlatformMonthlyCall>\n\n\n_______________
 _________________________________________________________________\n\nResou
 rces\n\nFollow us on Twitter @Microsoft365Dev<https://www.twitter.com/Micr
 osoft365Dev> for the latest announcements\n\nSubscribe to our Microsoft 36
 5 Dev YouTube channel<https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCV_6HOhwxYLXAGd-JOq
 KPoQ> for developer videos (includes previous call recordings)\n\nPower Pl
 atform<http://powerplatform.microsoft.com/>\n\nJoin the Microsoft 365 Deve
 loper Program<https://developer.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-365/dev-prog
 ram>\n
